    "Even if prerequisites were met, CS3281 must be before CS2105. CS3281 requires CS2103 (or variants). CS2103T is taken. CS2105 requires CS2040 (or variants). CS2040S is completed. The ordering constraint is satisfiable, but the prerequisite gaps for CS4243 and the missing CS4221 prerequisite (CS3223) create insurmountable issues. CS4221 requires CS3223. CS3223 requires CS2040S (done) and CS2102 (must-take). So CS3223 must be after CS2102. CS4221 must be after CS3223. This chain is long. Combined with CS4243's missing stats prereqs, no valid plan exists."
